    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Greedy reachability</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/jump-game/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 55</a></div>\n  <h1>Jump Game</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: the reachable squares always form one prefix [0, reach], so scan left to right, grow reach = max(reach, i + nums[i]), and fail only if some i lies beyond reach. O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
